{"title":"Starlight Sickle","slug":"Starlight_Sickle","hero":{"file":"Starlight_sickle.webp","width":258,"height":508},"pageid":4562,"revid":20271,"timestamp":"2025-10-31T21:57:50Z","lastEditor":"ToallyNoob4791","categories":["Infobox_templates"],"infobox":{"type":"Tool","fields":[{"label":"name","value":"Starlight Sickle"},{"label":"unboxed_image","value":"Starlight sickle.png"},{"label":"shop","value":"The Monstrous Manor"},{"label":"price","value":"10,250 Candy(For the Hardened Moon Rod)"},{"label":"function","value":"Close Range Weapon"},{"label":"version_added","value":"1.93.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Starlight Sickle</b> is an item added in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Halloween_Event/\">2025 Halloween event</a>. It can be obtained by placing a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Moon_Shard/\">Waning Crescent Moon Shard</a> and a <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hardened_Moon_Rod/\">Hardened Moon Rod</a> on the altar at the top of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor/\">The Manor</a>. Similarly to the other items from the event it can be made on top of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor/\">The Manor</a>. It Deals similar damage to the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dragonbone/\">Dragonbone</a> sword.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>"}
